<motion_principles>
Mobile-first, snappy physics — no unnecessary motion:

1. Response time < 80ms for all tap interactions.
2. Screen transitions: 150ms fade/slide. No spring physics. No overshoot.
3. Modal/Sheet entrance: 200ms slide-up with ease-out curve.
4. List items: No staggered entrance — all items appear instantly (snappy philosophy).
5. Button press: Scale 0.97 + opacity 0.7, duration 100ms.
6. Skeleton shimmer: Continuous 1.5s loop, subtle gradient.
7. Auto-save indicator: Fade-in 200ms, persist 1s, fade-out 200ms.

Forbidden:
- NO hover effects (mobile has no cursor)
- NO tiny clickable text links (minimum 44x44px touch targets)
- NO horizontal scroll inside vertical scroll without snap physics
- NO spring/bounce animations (conflicts with snappy philosophy)
- NO splash/ripple effects longer than 150ms
- NO parallax scrolling
- NO auto-playing videos or animated backgrounds
