<technical_architecture>
Stack:
- Framework: Flutter 3.x (Dart)
- Target: Android first → Desktop Windows (adaptive layout)
- Styling: Custom ThemeData with Material 3 foundation, fully customized color scheme and typography
- Animation: Flutter built-in ImplicitlyAnimatedWidget family (AnimatedContainer, AnimatedOpacity, AnimatedScale). No external animation libraries needed for snappy approach.
- Icons: Lucide Icons (lucide_icons package) — clean, consistent, outline style
- State Management: Riverpod (flutter_riverpod) — reactive, testable, scalable
- Local Database: Isar Database (isar package) — NoSQL, offline-first, blazing fast, full-text search built-in
- Encryption: AES-256 via encrypt package for backup files. flutter_secure_storage for PIN storage
- Biometric: local_auth package for fingerprint/face authentication
- Notifications: flutter_local_notifications for reminders (no server/FCM needed)
- File Export: pdf package for PDF generation, share_plus for system share sheet
- Markdown: flutter_markdown for rendering, markdown parser for syntax
- Image Handling: image_picker for attachments, cached locally in app directory

Performance Requirements:
- App cold start < 2 seconds
